    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9d599f64bc5d807b1a48157",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用大量当地食材熬煮的汤底，\\n味噌醇厚的滋味，营养也是满分！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f5862e666c41009e49d908dd68385dc7adc7dd1e1adad30f02807c8000fb1c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed84d59c50e377c1cfb4f514",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奶油般丝滑的豚骨浓汤和极细面是其特色。\\n再点一份加面吃到饱吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f74972912be1f280e1468bd38d115e8445d359a3dca817d618c3167f191615e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:205f63300626751612419042",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "清澈汤底蕴含满满的食材鲜味，\\n朴素外观下透出高贵气质的一碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60c6eb3424d6dcd1b65d6f47c865a318998523ed7151ed7d3a26f998ff496954",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28dcf6e80308c9ad0b138928",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "海鲜高汤与猪背脂的浓汤是其特色。\\n极粗面与散发海潮香的岩海苔风味充满魅力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a6b5d01fcc2892fd5f64c1fcfcc1a64573fbe2af67db3d681ad29e8d70e9712",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da900a53735521ddf1f807c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "清淡好下口的酱油汤底，\\n和Q弹面条相性拔群的一碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e4cdc017e453f41cb7cbc2b90656929a3a139b7a009db0e9b3b5467867d524",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e620ebcdd25eeecbee994f48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "极粗面和浓厚酱油风味的豚骨汤底，\\n厚切猪肉和堆积如山的蔬菜极具压迫感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2c4a3e0d5d04de11a935b9ddd0ec5c87084d16c7a436737275bbc054c255b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:845ad165eb7dbb9b547e5265",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "叉烧肉汁与酱油调制的\\n汤底是其特色。用作佐料的洋葱带来清爽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8c6c7a5c570600153fa0c075c6bbe85b09ff083e65dea6f4d05a1cd0f17f46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f99e17b3ff2199ae5950f70e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "满载蔬菜醇香的汤底，由鲜辣肉沫\\n和韭菜点缀，充满冲击力的滋味！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbea5b6f5b9cfc31060b14754c9345f111640f4d3b943f7f6a4c198e142b0a7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af7ddcf325ccee50628e758",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "酱油汤底里猪背脂的鲜甜令人上瘾！\\n再撒上满满的清脆大青葱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aac2b40e242eb940faf5387412b1938ec34d3db921400c5c656991e1e81d2c66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
